  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Rare (Requires Attunement by a Monk)</em></p><p>This finely detailed belt is made of dragonhide. While wearing it, you gain a +2 bonus to the saving throw DCs of your ki features.</p><p>In addition, you can use an action to regain ki points equal to a roll of your Martial Arts die. You can't use this action again until the next dawn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-dragonhideBeltNote\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The +2 DC bonus is applied via <code>system.bonuses.spell.dc</code>, which increases all ability-based save DCs (including ki). The Regain Focus activity rolls the Martial Arts die (<code>@scale.monk.die</code>) and restores that many Focus Points on the Monk's Focus feature. Requires the 2024 Monk class with the <strong>Monk's Focus</strong> feature (identifier: <code>monks-focus</code>).</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
